Definitions.
- In this Act, unless, the context otherwise requires: -
(a)
"Commission" means "The Jharkhand State Commission for the Scheduled Tribes" constituted under Section 3;
(b)
"Member" means a member of the Commission and includes the Chairman and the Vice Chairman of the Commission;
(c)
"Scheduled Tribes" shall have the meaning assigned in Article 342 of the Constitution of India;
